                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is like running into one of your best friends from high school and seeing he's an emaciated drug addict now, yeah he looks like your friend and he'll try and crack the same inside jokes from when you were kids, but it all rings hollow and you know that this is not the same friend you had.\n\nThis is without a doubt one of the worst ways to bring back a character. Making a component but out of his depth reporter turned washed up has-been into a muscular chiseled jaw having marvel 1 liner cracking caricature of what the devs think is cool these days\n\nLike the 9th season of scrubs, the 4th mass effect game and the 3rd Dead space game. Let's just all pretend like this never happened",
